WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:06.594
Let’s get you connected. Your fleet is the workspace where
you’ll organize devices and manage their updates.

2
00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:10.901
Open Get started. This gives you a clear view of what to do
next.

3
00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:15.223
Choose your wallet, or another sign-in method offered by your
console.

4
00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:21.975
This walkthrough uses a demo account. Approve the connection in
your own wallet; your private key stays there.

5
00:00:22.570 --> 00:00:25.983
Check that the console shows the account you intended to
connect.

6
00:00:26.570 --> 00:00:30.346
On your first visit, create your default fleet and approve the
request.

7
00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:34.877
Select your fleet. You can now manage its devices from this
workspace.

8
00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:41.271
You’re signed in and your fleet is selected. Next, let’s check
how many devices you can manage.
